            'en': 'We began along Avenida Costanera in Posadas. As seen in this opening shot, Pamela strides along the sunlit riverfront promenade. Bright sunshine illuminates her long dark hair, giving every movement a glowing golden shine.\n\nThe Posadas waterfront is the social heart of the city. With crisp winds blowing off the river, Pamela enjoyed every step as our crew captured frame after frame, taking in the pleasant riverfront breeze.'
